      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Select model/VAE and queue: only the original plan is generated, previewed and saved.\n2. Enable Settings > YuE2 > Enable optional score tools. In the YuE2 Score sidebar, View score from: 1. Inspect generated plan. Under Send to an editor, choose 2. Edit ABC here, then Use score in editor.\n3. Edit text in 2. Edit ABC here on the canvas. The sidebar now shows that editor; click Refresh to preview your changes.\n4. Unmute the greyed continuation nodes (#9, #14, #5\u00e2\u20ac\u201c8, #11), then queue to rebuild the edited plan and render audio.\nThe editor must be empty before copying a different score into it. All ABC text lives in the workflow; the sidebar is optional."
